WEBVTT

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:10.000
<i>I was up late the night before the
world as I knew it came crashing down.</i>

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:37.220
Hurry!

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.280
You okay, Hisashi?

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:53.600
You idiot!

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:54.470
But!

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:10.010
No! Go away!

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:11.050
Re—

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:11.740
Rei!

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:22.280
Hisashi!

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:23.470
See that?

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.050
You have to hit <i>them</i> in the head to make them stop.{Italics added -A0}

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:35.330
Rei! Hisashi! This way! Hurry!

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.100
Okay!

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:43.060
Shit...

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.420
What is this?!

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:57.470
