00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.450
<i>I'll be your wife, Takashi-chan!</i>

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:48.400
<i>Really? Like, really really?</i>

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:51.880
<i>Yeah! Let's pinky promise!</i>

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:56.830
<i>Why are you repeating a year?</i>

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:58.300
<i>You're a straight A student.</i>

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.330
<i>You just don't get it, Takashi.</i>

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.980
<i>We're in the same class again. Good times.</i>

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.730
Pinky promise...

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:21.230
Cross your heart, hope to die, stick a needle in your eye...

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:24.430
Are you stupid?

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:26.380
Takagi...

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:29.640
You always run off to the same spot whenever you have a problem.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.280
It's like you're a little kid.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.900
It's only the beginning of the semester.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.440
Keep cutting class and you'll have to take
after school classes or even worse, repeat.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.800
Hey, look who's talking.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.830
5th period isn't over yet, but here you are.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.170
It's okay for me to skip since I'm a genius.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.780
You, on the other hand, got in here thanks to a miracle.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.140
Hey, Takagi...

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:51.740
Why are you always—

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.040
I hate stupid people.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:57.290
I especially hate the ones who aren't aware of their own stupidity.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.030
Fortunately, you're not one of those people.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.000
So, if I keep telling you that you're stupid, then maybe you'll become less stupid.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:05.660
Stupid.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.140
What?

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.000
All this because your childhood crush dumped you?

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:14.700
So stupid.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:18.810
<i>About Takashi...</i>

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:25.330
<i>I did feel that way about him back then, but he never noticed, so...</i>

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.880
So? So what?

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:41.610
Who's that?

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:42.960
He looks strange.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:50.600
Excuse me, but what do you think you're doing?

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.550
Quit that!

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:54.960
Now now, Hayashi-sensei.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.020
I'll take care of him.

00:05:59.160 --> 00:05:59.920
Hey!

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.800
Whoa, Tejima-sensei!

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.210
Don't resort to violence...

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:25.690
H-He's dead...

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:27.640
No way...

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.500
It was just a bite...

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.530
Are you okay, Tejima-sensei?

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.650
Tejima-sensei!

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:40.040
What a reli—

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:00.230
Komuro!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:03.160
Couldn't just skip class, could you? You had to disturb the others' learning environment too!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.170
Come on, we're getting out of here.

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.190
Wh-What?

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.110
What's going on, Takashi?

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:12.180
Some people at the school gate just got killed. It's too dangerous to stay here.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:13.830
Seriously?

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.980
What would I stand to gain from lying about this?

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.980
Back up!

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.190
I never understand what you're thinking—

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:23.850
Wh—

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.640
Shut up and listen!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:32.640
So are you going to tell us what's going on?

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:34.540
Someone was at the school gate.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.420
When the gym teachers went to
check it out, something happened.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:39.800
And now those gym teachers are killing each other.

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:41.600
We're supposed to believe that?

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.510
What is it? You forget something?

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:48.280
If what you said is true, then we'll need weapons.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:50.710
Here you go, Rei.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:51.730
What about you?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.850
I might not look like one, but I'm a black belt in karate.

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:55.830
Anyway, let's get out of here.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.480
Let me call the police. My dad is an officer.{my dad is at the police sounds dumb}

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.290
Rules were meant to be broken, right?

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:11.970
No way...

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:13.510
What is it?

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:18.090
<i>Please wait and call again later.</i>

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:23.280
<i>The police emergency line is busy at the moment.</i>

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:28.030
<i>Please wait and call again later.</i>

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:28.190
The line is busy? No way...

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.590
Attention, all students!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.200
Violence has broken out on campus!

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:38.350
Students should evacuate the campus
according to their teacher's instructions.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:40.930
I repeat.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.560
Violence has broken out on campus!

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:42.450
They finally noticed.

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:45.530
Students should evacuate campus—

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:50.360
No way...

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:56.250
Help! Save me!

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:00.510
Hirano.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:02.980
Takagi-san...

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:04.370
We're getting out of here.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:09.580
No! Help!

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:37.210
Move!

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:45.840
This way!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.820
We aren't running outside?

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.900
Everyone is running out of the classrooms.

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:51.350
We'll escape through the admin office!

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:55.020
Hisashi is always right. Just do what he says.

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:56.500
I know!

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:04.950
Isn't that our Modern Japanese teacher, Wakisaka-sensei?

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:09.190
Careful! He's—

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:23.130
No! Go away!

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:24.870
Rei! Stab him!

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.790
Don't hold back! Just do it!

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.300
No!

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:41.300
Don't screw with a member of the Sojutsu Club!

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:49.640
All right!

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:03.770
No way!

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.550
I pierced him in the heart!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.100
Why is he still moving?!

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:10.770
Pull it out now!

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:13.130
Get away from him, Hisashi!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:16.500
Don't worry. I can take him.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:23.390
Why is he so strong?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.520
Let go of Hisashi, dammit!

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:29.760
Hisashi!

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:34.200
Why?

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.020
Why hasn't he let go yet?!

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:37.650
I knew it...

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:39.280
He's dead.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.620
He's dead but he's moving!

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:46.760
Hisashi!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.770
Help him, Takashi!

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.110
Aren't you a man?!

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:54.290
Just...

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:55.870
Just do something!

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:12.670
Are you okay, Hisashi?

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:16.540
It's just a scratch. Nothing to worry about.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:22.070
No! Don't bite me!

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.130
We can't take on all of them by ourselves.

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:26.880
Get to the roof.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:28.190
The roof?

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.190
We'll hide ourselves up there until help arrives.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.390
The astronomy observatory is up there.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:49.520
What the...

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.960
What the hell is going on?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.320
Everything was normal until a while ago!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:09.990
Blackhawks?

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:11.660
The US Army?

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.660
No, that's our SDF.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:17.330
But where did they come from? There's no base around here.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.800
Save us!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:20.640
Don't bother.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:24.970
They wouldn't come all the way out here unless they had a reason to.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:28.590
They're probably on a special mission.

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.180
They don't have time to save us.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.350
They're not even doing anything about this.

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:37.110
You could try to escape down there even though it's a total mess.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.910
No! Stop!

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.470
Someone, please help!

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:40.340
Owww!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.370
I wonder what's going on inside school...

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:46.040
We should be okay as long as we're together, Misuzu!

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:50.080
Of course! We'll be best friends forever, Toshimi!

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:57.400
No! S-Save me!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.870
Save me, Misuzu!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:00.190
Let go!

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.750
I said LET GO!

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:15.060
They're here too?

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.790
This isn't happening.

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:22.670
It's a dream.

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:25.120
Yeah, it's all a nightmare.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:29.020
I need to wake up and get to school.

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:33.230
I have to harass the new members today.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:42.320
It's <i>them</i>. <i>They</i> infect you with some kind of disease.{Italics added -A0}

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:43.480
<i>Them</i>?{Italics added -A0}

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:49.170
We're being attacked by corpses, but this is no movie or video game.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:50.850
So they are <i>them</i>.{as opposed to zombies, which you're apparently not allowed to use in this series}{Italics added -A0}

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:56.990
<i>They</i> eat people and whoever gets eaten comes back as one of <i>them</i>.{Italics added -A0}

00:14:57.990 --> 00:14:59.220
And I don't understand why,

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:02.240
but the only way to kill them is with a blow to the head.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.260
So what do we do?

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.000
Get up there. We'll block the stairs.

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:12.530
Let's go!

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:24.270
R-Rei!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:37.690
Why...

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.760
Why is this happening?

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.470
There must be a reason.

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:46.190
If we knew the reason, we could figure out what to do.

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:56.570
Let's look for a lighter or some matches in the observatory.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:03.550
If we don't make a fire now,
we won't be able to see them at ni—

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.330
Hisashi! What's wrong?!

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:12.750
Takashi! Hisashi is...

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:29.420
But...

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:30.640
Why...

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:32.990
That bite was tiny...

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:34.880
Why has your condition gotten so bad?

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.690
It's just like in the movies.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:40.860
There's no stopping it after you get bitten.

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:45.100
No way! Stuff that happens in movi—

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.600
Everything around us is playing out like a movie.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:54.350
Takashi.

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.640
Help me.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:58.860
Help you with what?

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.450
If I fall off from there,

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:11.480
the fall will probably crush my head...

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:16.470
What're you getting at?!

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.370
I don't want to be one of <i>them</i>!{Italics added -A0}

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:21.410
Hisashi!

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:23.600
Hisashi!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:24.900
No!

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:33.870
Come on...

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:35.750
Takashi, I'm begging you...

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.630
I want to die as myself.

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:48.810
Hisashi!

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:50.760
Why?!

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:54.840
No!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:59.300
DON'T DIE!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:37.200
Rei, get back.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:42.530
No!

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.470
You can't kill him!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:45.610
He isn't going to...

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:48.220
He isn't going to turn into one of <i>them</i>!{Italics added -A0}

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:50.190
He's special!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.130
Get back.

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:55.280
Hisashi?

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:57.850
See Takashi?

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.820
Hisashi wouldn't die from—

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:05.830
Hisashi...

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:11.580
What is it?

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:16.340
Hisashi!

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:19.260
No way.

