This really is unbelievable.

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:30.510
So unbelievable that it's stupid.

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.020
Takashi...

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:36.960
And yet...

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:38.480
Stop.

