Owaranai Sekai no Naka de

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:56.930
Amidst this never ending world,

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:56.930
終わらない　世界の中で

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:06.750
Sakimidareta Saigo no Kotoba yo

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:06.750
your last words sprung up all over the place{Probably referring to Hisashi's last request - I wanna die as myself}

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:06.750
咲き乱れた　最後の言葉よ

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:11.730
So real and distant

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:11.730
So real and distant

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:18.740
Mou Furikaeranai

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:18.740
Quit turning your head away

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:18.740
無垢に帰らない

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:24.400
Koe o Karashite Sakebe

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:24.400
Scream that with your coarse voice

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:24.400
声を枯らして叫べ

