Atarimae no Nichijou ga Hateru

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:33.850
My normal daily life ended

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:33.850
当たり前の　日常が果てる

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:42.390
Kimi to Taiyou ga Shinda Hi

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:42.390
on the day you and the sun died

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:42.390
君と太陽が死んだ日

