Nozomanai Noizu no Uzu ni

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:52.150
I secretly got swallowed

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:52.150
望まない　ノイズの渦に

00:20:52.750 --> 00:21:02.000
Hitoshirezu ni Nomikomarete Yuku

00:20:52.750 --> 00:21:02.000
by the spiral of noise I didn't want to hear

00:20:52.750 --> 00:21:02.000
人知れずに飲み込まれてゆく

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:14.080
Wasurenaide Watashi no Koe o

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:14.080
Don't forget what my voice sounds like

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:14.080
忘れないで　私の声を

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:19.400
Mata Daeu Sono Hi Made

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:19.400
until the day we meet again

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:19.400
また出会うその日まで

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:22.560
Why...

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:24.780
Why...

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.800
You would've been eaten if I hadn't.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:31.830
I didn't want you to save me.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:36.070
I didn't want to see him like this!

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:41.780
I would've rather gotten bitten by Hisashi
and become one of <i>them</i> than live like this!{Italics added -A0}

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:44.730
I don't think Hisashi wanted that.

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:49.190
Oh please Takashi, what do you know?

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:53.390
Oh right. Yeah, that's it.

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:57.280
You must've really hated him!

00:21:57.650 --> 00:21:59.370
Since we were dating!

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:07.620
Wait, where are you going?

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.070
I feel like I'm bothering you.

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:12.940
So... I'm gonna go smash some heads.

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:15.050
What?

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:17.610
You can't do that by yourself!

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:24.190
Hey... Takashi...

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:27.790
Don't!

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:29.060
Stop!

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:33.530
I'm sorry! I didn't mean what I said! I really didn't!

00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:39.810
Please! Please stay here with me!

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:01.360
<i>On that day, when the world came crashing down,</i>

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:05.870
<i>I killed my best friend,</i>

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:10.940
<i>and held the woman I loved for the first time.</i>

00:23:26.580 --> 00:23:29.490
<i>Do you know what happens...</i>

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:28.580
{Saya}I wanna live!

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:31.160
{Rei}Dad?! You can't hear my voice?!

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:30.600
{Takashi?}Eat this!

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:35.210
Stop!
